1c-enterprise83-starter (2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Support current 1C:Enterprise layout (/opt/1cv8, 8.3.18+ and 8.5):
    bases are started through /opt/1cv8/common/1cestart, which picks
    the platform version itself.
  * Detect infobases by file signature as well as by file name.
  * Proper Debian source package built with debhelper.
  * Drop hard dependency on versioned 1C client packages.
  * Build and publish releases with GitHub Actions.

